  "query_preview": "heat wave will be the lack of night time recovery. Lows \nin the upper 70s to a few at or above 80 over the next week will \nstress at risk populations due to lack of cooling. Current Heat \nAdvisories and Extreme Heat Warnings are through Sunday, but \nproducts will likely be needed further into next week.\n\nA brief relief from the peak of the heating could be on the table\nearly next week. The center of the ridge will slide west and\ncould allow for a weak system to ride along the edge. This will\nincrease PoPs and cloud cover which may help break up the streak\nof truly oppressive conditions. The ridge will re-strengthen and\nslide back eastward to by mid to late next week and help\nreinvigorate heat and humidity.",
